Q: How to combine an Image Button, Action and Navigation Link together? A: <pre><code>struct YourView: View {
    @State private var navigate = false

    var body: some View {
        // 1. Hidden NavigationLink driven by state
        NavigationLink(destination: NewUI(), isActive: $navigate) {
            EmptyView()
        }
        .hidden()

        // 2. Button does the work, then flips the state
        Button(action: {
            print(&quot;I am new to SwiftUI!&quot;)
            buttonFunction()
            navigate = true   // triggers the NavigationLink above
        }) {
            Image(buttonImage)
                .resizable()
                .frame(maxWidth: 50, maxHeight: 50)
        }
    }

    func buttonFunction() {
        // all your logic here
    }
}
</code></pre>

Q: Flutter Hive Error: The box &quot;cartbox&quot; is already open and of type Box&lt;Product&gt; A: <p>The error clearly states that the Hive box is already opened:
<code>The box &quot;cartbox&quot; is already open..</code></p>
<p>I've had this issue before, the fix is simple: Check if the box is arleady opened before trying to open it.</p>
<p>You can use the <a href="https://pub.dev/documentation/hive/latest/hive/HiveInterface/isBoxOpen.html" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><code>isBoxOpen</code></a> method. Something like this in your <code>main</code> method:</p>
<p>Instead of  just:</p>
<pre><code>await Hive.openBox&lt;Product&gt;('cartbox');
</code></pre>
<p>Use:</p>
<pre><code>if (!isBoxOpen('cartbox') {
  await Hive.openBox&lt;Product&gt;('cartbox');
}
</code></pre>
